                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Cellular respiration is a process that occurs in the cells of living organisms. It involves the breakdown of nutrients, specifically glucose, to produce energy in the form of adenosine triphosphate (ATP). This process takes place in the mitochondria, which are often referred to as the \"powerhouses\" of the cell.\n\nSo, the correct answer is:\n\nB) nutrients",
