                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: What type of object reflects light?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n- Light can bounce off of objects and reflect back to our eyes.\n- Some objects reflect light better than others.\n- Option A, tadpole, is not an object that reflects light.\n- Option D, black hole, is a region of space with a gravitational pull so strong that nothing, including light, can escape it. Therefore, it cannot reflect light.\n- Option B, any object, is too broad and not specific enough.\n- Option C, item that reflects, is the most accurate answer as it specifies that the object must have the ability to reflect light.\n\nAnswer: C) item that reflects.",
                        "answers": [
