                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": " In order for photosynthesis to happen, what does a plant need? \n\nA plant needs sunlight, water, and carbon dioxide. \n\nSo, if we were to write a recipe for photosynthesis, we would need to include those three ingredients.",
