                        "cot": "Step 1: Determine the total number of episodes and their duration.\nUgly Betty has 4 seasons with a total of 85 episodes. Each episode has an approximate runtime of 42 minutes.\n\nStep 2: Calculate the total time required to watch all episodes.\nTotal time = Number of episodes * Duration of each episode\nTotal time = 85 episodes * 42 minutes/episode\nTotal time = 3570 minutes\n\nStep 3: Convert the total time to hours.\nTotal time = 3570 minutes \u00f7 60 minutes/hour\nTotal time = 59.5 hours\n\nStep 4: Determine if a week is enough time to watch all episodes.\nA week has 7 days, and each day has 24 hours.\nTotal hours in a week = 7 days * 24 hours/day\nTotal hours in a week = 168 hours\n\nSince 59.5 hours (total time to watch all episodes) is less than 168 hours (total hours in a week), a week would be enough time to watch every episode of Ugly Betty.\n\nAnswer: A) True",
