                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nStep 1: What is the rock cycle?\nThe rock cycle is the process by which rocks are formed, broken down, and transformed into different types of rocks over time.\n\nStep 2: What are the three types of rocks?\nThe three types of rocks are igneous, sedimentary, and metamorphic.\n\nStep 3: What is an igneous rock?\nAn igneous rock is a type of rock that forms from the cooling and solidification of magma or lava.\n\nStep 4: What is the answer?\nTherefore, the answer is A) cooling temperatures, as an igneous rock forms from the cooling and solidification of magma or lava.",
