                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Plan:\n1. Identify the atmospheric layers in order from lowest to highest: troposphere, stratosphere, mesosphere, thermosphere.\n2. Recall that the temperature decreases as altitude increases.\n3. Determine which atmospheric layer the summit of Mount Everest is located in based on the temperature change.\n\nAnswer:\nThe summit of Mount Everest is located in the troposphere.",
