                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: What is the term for the freezing and expanding of water in the cracks of rocks?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n\n- Freezing and expanding of water in the cracks of rocks is a natural process that can cause physical changes to the rocks.\n- This process is not related to the deposition of sediment or the movement of tectonic plates, so options B and C can be eliminated.\n- The term for the physical breakdown of rocks due to natural processes is weathering.\n- Therefore, the answer is A) weathering.\n\nAnswer: A) weathering.",
