                        "cot": " \n\nFirst, we need to identify what is meant by \"gravitational energy.\" Gravitational energy is the energy that an object has due to its position in a gravitational field. \n\nNext, we need to identify which alternative energy resources use gravitational energy. Tidal energy and hydropower are two examples of alternative energy resources that use gravitational energy. \n\nGeothermal energy and wind energy do not use gravitational energy to make electricity.",
