                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Plan:\n1. Recall the properties of a mirror.\n2. Identify what happens to light when it hits a mirror.\n3. Determine which option matches the identified property.\n\nAnswer:\n1. A mirror is a smooth and shiny surface that reflects light.\n2. When light hits a mirror, it bounces off the surface and changes direction.\n3. The option that matches the identified property is B) reflected. Therefore, when light hits a mirror, most of the light is reflected.",
