                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: What is the shared characteristic of birds, mammals, and reptiles that Lamar learned makes them all vertebrates?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n- Lamar learned that birds, mammals, and reptiles are all vertebrates.\n- Vertebrates are a group of animals that have a backbone.\n- Therefore, the shared characteristic of birds, mammals, and reptiles that makes them all vertebrates is that they all have a backbone.\n\nAnswer: C) They all have a backbone.",
