                        "cot": "\n1. Plants that can live in sandy soils most likely have the ability to withstand dry conditions.\n2. Dry conditions can be caused by a lack of water.\n3. A lack of water can be caused by a drought.\n4. Drought can be caused by a lack of precipitation.\n5. A lack of precipitation can be caused by clouds.\n6. Clouds can be caused by fires.\n7. Fires can burn plants.\n8. Plants that can live in sandy soils most likely have the ability to withstand fires.\n\nPlants that can live in sandy soils most likely have the ability to withstand fires.",
