                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Plan:\n1. Identify the special parts that capture sunlight in plant cells.\n2. Determine which part of the plant is responsible for photosynthesis.\n3. Identify which part of the plant has the most surface area exposed to sunlight.\n4. Choose the option that matches the above criteria.\n\nAnswer:\n1. The special parts that capture sunlight in plant cells are called chloroplasts.\n2. Photosynthesis occurs in the leaves of the plant.\n3. Leaves have the most surface area exposed to sunlight due to their flat and thin structure.\n4. Therefore, the answer is C) leaves.",
